          deckDescription: 'Eighty-four-card Chinese domino pack (十五湖紙牌): 21 tile types (all pairs from 1-1 to 6-6), four copies of each. Cards are long and narrow with spots at both ends; ones and fours in red, 6-6 half red, others black. Civil suit (文子) and two military groups (武子) with distinct rankings.',
          suitDescription: 'Civil suit (文子) and two military suit groups (武子 group 1 and group 2). Civil has 11 cards; each military group has 9-, 8-, 7- and 5-spot cards; supreme pair [2:4] and [1:2] in military.',
          rankDescription: 'Within each suit cards rank high to low; civil same as Tien Gow. Mixed combinations: Heaven [6:6] with nines, Earth [1:1] with eights, Person [4:4] with sevens, Goose [1:3] with fives. Supreme [2:4]+[1:2] unbeatable.',
